# copier.env.example — optional environment overrides for copier.service
#
# Copy to copier.env to activate; copier.service reads it via
# `EnvironmentFile=-/home/tom/copier/copier.env` (the '-' makes it optional).
# systemd parses this as KEY=VALUE lines — no `export`, no shell expansion,
# no inline comments after a value. After editing:
#     sudo systemctl restart copier.service
#
# ===========================================================================
# SAFE knobs (no live trading)
# ===========================================================================

# TCP port for the dashboard + REST API (default 7332). If you change this,
# also update the ExecStartPre `fuser -k <port>/tcp` line in copier.service.
#COPIER_PORT=7332

# State + dashboard file locations (defaults resolve relative to WorkingDirectory).
#COPIER_STATE=/home/tom/copier/copier_state.json
#COPIER_DASHBOARD=/home/tom/copier/copier_dashboard.html

# ===========================================================================
# LIVE trading — real money. DO NOT uncomment without Tom's explicit go.
# Read ~/copier/copier_server.py EXECUTION INTERFACE block first.
# ===========================================================================
#
# Master switch. Unset/anything-but-1 => SIMULATION. Setting =1 alone does
# NOT place orders: each account still needs an explicit route below, and the
# blocked-account guard still applies. No route => that account fails closed.
#COPIER_LIVE=1
#
# Per-account routing map (single-line JSON). Maps each copier account_key to a
# broker account. connector defaults to "rithmic" if omitted.
#   {"<copier_account_key>": {"connector":"rithmic","broker_account_id":"<id>"}}
# Example (illustrative IDs — replace with real ones):
#COPIER_LIVE_ROUTES={"tom_cash":{"connector":"rithmic","broker_account_id":"DEMO123"},"mffu_rapid_50k":{"connector":"rithmic","broker_account_id":"DEMO456"}}
#
# Broker account IDs the copier must NEVER touch, comma-separated.
# Default already hard-blocks 229107 (ff-bot's funded live account) even if a
# route points at it. Only override if you know exactly why.
#COPIER_BLOCKED_BROKER_ACCOUNTS=229107
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Pre-live checklist (see ~/.claude/.../memory/copier-service.md):
#   1. A reachable target exists. Today the connector is a single singleton on
#      the bot's one Rithmic .env login: the `mffu` credential_set is NOT
#      reachable, and tom_cash has no broker account there. Per-credential-set
#      connectors must be built first.
#   2. Test on a DEMO account. None exists today (RITHMIC_SERVER_TYPE=live).
#   3. Add auth / localhost-bind to :7332 (currently open on the tailnet).
#   4. Handle stop-limit / trailing order types (currently rejected, fail-closed).
#   5. Tom's explicit per-account mapping + go.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
